Scope

This license covers the work added in this fork:

  - everything under gnome/ (GNOME app, sign-in helper, Shell extension,
    icons, install and uninstall scripts)
  - photos.py and test_photos.py
  - this fork's changes to driver.py, test_driver.py, icloudctl, README.md
    and .gitignore

It does not cover the original icloud-linux code by Ismaeel Akram
(https://github.com/IsmaeelAkram/icloud-linux), which was published without
a license. Those portions remain under their author's copyright.
